  <h1>Data &amp; Account Deletion</h1>
  <p class="meta">Effective date: 1 January 2026 &nbsp;·&nbsp; Version 1.0</p>
</header>

<div class="box">
  <p><strong>App:</strong> Durar — Jewelry Museum &amp; Store</p>
  <p><strong>Developer:</strong> Enas Ibrahim</p>
  <p><strong>Platform:</strong> Android / iOS</p>
</div>

<div class="note">
  You can delete your account and all associated personal data directly from inside the app,
  without contacting support. No email request is required.
</div>

<h2>1) Delete account and all related data</h2>

<p>
  Follow these steps to permanently delete your Durar account:
</p>
<ol>
  <li>Open the Durar app.</li>
  <li>From the bottom navigation bar, tap <strong>"حسابي"</strong> (Account / Profile).</li>
  <li>Tap the <strong>"الأمان"</strong> (Security) tile in the menu grid.</li>
  <li>Scroll to the <strong>Account Deletion</strong> section.</li>
  <li>Tap <strong>"احذف حسابك"</strong> (Delete Your Account).</li>
  <li>Read the confirmation dialog and tap <strong>"نعم، احذف حسابي"</strong> to confirm.</li>
</ol>

<div class="warn">
  <strong>This action is permanent and cannot be undone.</strong>
  Once confirmed, you will be signed out immediately.
</div>

<h3>What gets deleted</h3>
<p>Deletion removes the following from our systems and from your device:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Your account record, including name, email address, and phone number.</li>
  <li>Your profile photo / avatar.</li>
  <li>Your saved delivery addresses.</li>
  <li>Your wishlist (favourites).</li>
  <li>Your cart contents.</li>
  <li>Your order history and invoices.</li>
  <li>Your museum ticket bookings and visitor records.</li>
  <li>Your auction bid history and winnings.</li>
  <li>Your product reviews.</li>
  <li>Your notification history.</li>
  <li>Your locally stored session token and device identifier.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Data retention after deletion</h3>
<p>
  Most data is erased immediately. However, a limited subset may be retained for up to
  <strong>90 days</strong> where retention is required for legal, tax, fraud-prevention, or
  security reasons — for example invoices and transaction records required by commercial law.
  This retained data is stored in a restricted, non-active form and is never used for
  marketing or profiling. It is purged automatically once the retention period expires.
</p>

<h3>Consequences of deletion</h3>
<ul>
  <li>You will no longer be able to access your orders, bookings, or bid history.</li>
  <li>Any active auction bids you placed will no longer be linked to your account.</li>
  <li>Any museum tickets already issued cannot be re-issued under a new account.</li>
  <li>Creating a new account afterwards starts from a completely fresh state.</li>
</ul>

<h2>2) Delete or edit specific data (without deleting the account)</h2>

<p>
  You can also manage individual pieces of personal data from inside the app while keeping
  your account active:
</p>

<h3>Edit your profile information</h3>
<ol>
  <li>Open the app and go to <strong>"حسابي"</strong> (Account / Profile).</li>
  <li>Tap the <strong>edit</strong> (pencil) icon on your profile card.</li>
  <li>Update your name, phone number, or profile photo.</li>
  <li>Tap <strong>"حفظ"</strong> (Save).</li>
</ol>
<p>You can repeat this at any time to change your details again.</p>

<h3>Remove saved data</h3>
<ul>
  <li>
    <strong>Wishlist / Favourites</strong> — go to
    <em>Profile → المفضلة</em>, tap the heart icon on any item to remove it individually,
    or use wishlist removal options to clear the list.
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Cart</strong> — open the cart and remove individual items, or clear the cart.
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Saved addresses</strong> — remove a saved delivery address from your profile.
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Your review</strong> — reviews you publish on products remain visible. Contact us
    at the email below to request removal of a specific review.
  </li>
</ul>

<h3>Sign out without deleting</h3>
<p>
  To end your session on a shared device without removing your data, use
  <strong>"تسجيل الخروج"</strong> (Log out) at the bottom of the Profile tab. This clears
  the local session token only — your account and data remain intact.
</p>

<h2>3) Requesting deletion another way</h2>

<p>
  If you are unable to access the app (for example, you have lost access to your registered
  email or phone), you can request account deletion by contacting us. We will verify your
  identity and process the request within <strong>30 days</strong>.
</p>

